    "goal": "Co-incubate UGT2B7 with UDPGA (substrate) in the presence of a competitive inhibitor and report run-condition IC50, percent inhibition, inhibitor:substrate molar ratio, and inhibited reaction velocity.",
    "rationale": "UGT2B7 glucuronidation of UDPGA is modeled as a competitive-inhibition Michaelis-Menten reaction. Substrate [S]=1082.2 µM with Km=1195.6 µM; competitive inhibitor at [I]=132.1 µM with Ki=146.0 µM; Vmax=1.3033 µmol/min. Run-condition IC50 follows Cheng-Prusoff (IC50=Ki(1+[S]/Km)); fractional activity v_i/v_0=[S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]); percent inhibition=(1-fraction)*100; inhibited velocity=fraction*Vmax; molar ratio=[I]/[S].",
